# Operator key/address dumps. `privkeys.txt` alone did not cover the names the
# app and the generator actually produce (e.g. wallets_100_private_keys.txt),
# so a plain `git add .` would have staged real private keys.
wallets*.txt
*private_key*
*privkey*
*mnemonic*
*seed_phrase*
*.key
*.pem
results/
logs/
debug_*.json

# Public/ is a local runtime / ship folder — never commit binaries or secrets
